          "image_source": "images/page_13_image_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.251,
            0.833,
            0.272
          ],
          "content": "**Converting subtraction to addition and addition to subtraction**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.288,
            0.794,
            0.308
          ],
          "content": "Recall that **Target Floor – Starting Floor = Movement needed**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.458,
            0.321,
            0.49,
            0.336
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "or"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.194,
            0.348,
            0.752,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": "**Target Floor = Starting Floor + Movement needed**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.379,
            0.833,
            0.4
          ],
          "content": "If we start at 2 and wish to go to –3, what is the movement needed?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.408,
            0.833,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": "**First method:** Looking at the number line, we see we need to move –5 (i.e., 5 in the backward direction). Therefore, **– 3 – 2 = – 5**. The movement needed is –5."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.483,
            0.815,
            0.503
          ],
          "content": "**Second method:** Break the journey from 2 to –3 into two parts."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.506,
            0.596,
            0.525
          ],
          "content": "a. From 2 to 0, the movement is 0–2=–2."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.528,
            0.617,
            0.548
          ],
          "content": "b. From 0 to –3, the movement is –3–0=–3."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.551,
            0.83,
            0.571
          ],
          "content": "The total movement is the sum of the two movements: **– 3 + (– 2) = – 5**."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.58,
            0.833,
            0.623
          ],
          "content": "Look at the two coloured expressions. There is no subtraction in the second one!"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.633,
            0.834,
            0.699
          ],
          "content": "In this way, we can always convert subtraction to addition. **The number that is being subtracted can be replaced by its inverse and then added instead.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.709,
            0.834,
            0.774
          ],
          "content": "**Similarly, a number that is being added can be replaced by its inverse and then subtracted.** In this way, we can also always convert addition to subtraction."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.777,
            0.271,
            0.797
          ],
          "content": "**Examples:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.806,
            0.412,
            0.826
          ],
          "content": "(+7)-(+5)=(+7)+(-5)",
          "image_source": "images/page_13_equation_23.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.829,
            0.408,
            0.848
          ],
          "content": "b. (– 3) – (+ 8) = (– 3) + (– 8)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.852,
            0.408,
            0.871
          ],
          "content": "c. (+ 8) –(–2) = (+ 8) + (+ 2)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.874,
            0.409,
            0.894
          ],
          "content": "d. (+ 6) – (– 9) = (+ 6) + (+ 9)"
        },
        {
